criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* patients diagnosed with relapsed/refractory multiple myeloma according to IMWG criteria who have undergone allogeneic hematopoietic stem cell transplantation;
* Age ≥ 18 years;
* Signature of the informed consent form (where possible).

Exclusion Criteria:

* Patients diagnosed with primary AL amyloidosis, monoclonal gammopathy of undetermined significance (MGUS), indolent multiple myeloma, or primary plasma cell leukemia;
* Patients who have not undergone allogeneic hematopoietic stem cell transplantation;
* Age \< 18 years.
